<title>UK: Crediop unit sets 10 billion drachma two-year bond.</title>
<headline>Crediop unit sets 10 billion drachma two-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager Chase.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CREDIOP OVERSEAS BANK LTD</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  CREDIOP</p>
<p> AMT     10 BLN GRD   COUPON     9.20	MATURITY    16.JUL.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.75    PAY DATE    16.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.00	REOFFER    99.85     SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (M) 1	   SALE LIMITS US/GB</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  ITALY     TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.10	SELL CONC  0.90</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
